{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium enterprise SaaS workflow section that visually explains the Area Manager workflow inside a retail operations platform.
    
    STYLE DIRECTION:
    - Modern SaaS landing page
    - Clean Japanese enterprise software aesthetic
    - Soft off-white background
    - Navy blue typography
    - Olive-green accent color
    - Minimal line icons
    - Rounded cards
    - Elegant whitespace
    - Figma-quality UI
    - Apple-style spacing and hierarchy
    
    SECTION HEADER:
    
    Top pill badge:
    "エリア管理"
    
    Large centered headline:
    "エリアマネージャーは、担当店舗の変化を短時間で把握。"
    
    Supporting paragraph:
    "Flowは、担当店舗のKPI、Pulse、メモ、店舗報告をまとめて確認できるようにし、優先して見るべき店舗や変化を把握しやすくします。"
    
    Maximum width centered layout.
    
    ---
    
    WORKFLOW VISUALIZATION
    
    Create a horizontal workflow timeline connecting 5 process cards.
    
    Design requirements:
    
    - Thin olive-green connecting line running through all steps
    - Small circular milestones between steps
    - Floating icon circles above each card
    - Large step numbers
    - Modern workflow feel
    - Clean visual hierarchy
    - Equal spacing between steps
    
    Desktop:
    5 cards in one horizontal row
    
    Tablet:
    Scrollable horizontal workflow
    
    Mobile:
    Vertical workflow timeline
    
    ---
    
    STEP 01
    
    Icon:
    Document / Report icon
    
    Number:
    01
    
    Title:
    レポートをサマリー
    
    Description:
    すべての担当店舗から上がった報告をまとめて確認します。
    
    ---
    
    STEP 02
    
    Icon:
    Analytics / KPI chart icon
    
    Number:
    02
    
    Title:
    KPIを比較・分析
    
    Description:
    売上・来店数・購買率の変化を比較し、傾向を把握します。
    
    ---
    
    STEP 03
    
    Icon:
    Alert / Priority icon
    
    Number:
    03
    
    Title:
    優先対応店舗を特定
    
    Description:
    変化やアラートをもとに、優先して見るべき店舗を抽出します。
    
    ---
    
    STEP 04
    
    Icon:
    Store icon
    
    Number:
    04
    
    Title:
    訪問準備を整える
    
    Description:
    店舗のKPI履歴やメモ、直近の変化を確認し、訪問に備えます。
    
    ---
    
    STEP 05
    
    Icon:
    Checklist / Clipboard icon
    
    Number:
    05
    
    Title:
    本部へ報告・共有
    
    Description:
    担当エリアの状況とアクションを整理し、効率的に報告します。
    
    ---
    
    CARD DESIGN
    
    Each step card should have:
    
    - White background
    - Rounded corners (16-20px)
    - Thin subtle border
    - Soft shadow
    - Large icon circle overlapping the top edge
    - Olive-green line icon
    - Large olive-green step number
    - Bold navy title
    - Muted gray description
    - Consistent card heights
    
    Hover state:
    - Slight lift
    - Stronger shadow
    - Subtle olive accent
    
    ---
    
    BOTTOM INSIGHT BANNER
    
    Add a centered highlight banner beneath the workflow.
    
    Style:
    - Soft blue-gray background
    - Rounded pill shape
    - Light bulb icon
    - Subtle shadow
    
    Text:
    "データの収集から報告までを一気通貫でつなぎ、エリアの成果最大化をサポートします。"
    
    ---
    
    OVERALL FEEL
    
    The section should feel like:
    - A clear operational workflow
    - A process visualization rather than a feature list
    - Enterprise retail management software
    - Modern SaaS product marketing
    - Clean, trustworthy, professional, and highly polished, make the icons selectable and we cam change the border radius of t he icons
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-workflow-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: 80px 20px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-workflow-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .ai-workflow-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .ai-workflow-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-workflow-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-workflow-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 80px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.line_color }};
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-workflow-icon-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_circle_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_circle_size }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_circle_bg }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.icon_border_radius }}%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    border:1px solid;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-icon-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .ai-workflow-milestone-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 74px;
    right: -18px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.line_color }};
    border: 3px solid {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child .ai-workflow-milestone-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 32px 24px 28px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    min-height: 240px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 48px;
 font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.number_color }};
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    opacity: 0.15;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_title_size }}px;
 font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.step_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_desc_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.step_desc_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-workflow-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.banner_bg_color }};
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 20px 40px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-banner-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-workflow-banner-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-workflow-banner-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: {{ block.settings.banner_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-workflow-banner-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.banner_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.banner_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-workflow-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      overflow-x: auto;
      overflow-y: hidden;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .ai-workflow-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-width: 280px;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }

    .ai-workflow-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: max-content;
      min-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-workflow-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 0;
    }

    .ai-workflow-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom:30px;
    }


    .ai-workflow-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .ai-workflow-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display:none;

    }

    .ai-workflow-icon-circle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display:none;
    }

    .ai-workflow-milestone-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display:none;
    }

    .ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-left: 0;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .ai-workflow-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-width: auto;
    }

    .ai-workflow-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      border-radius: 24px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-banner-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.banner_text_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

